#ROOM
Vnum     10100
Name     Before The Assembly Hall~
Sector   city~
Desc     You stand outside the enormous Assembly Hall on Earth where council heads
meet once a month to discuss issues of galactic importance. Included in
the Assembly Hall is a ring of opinion booths available for citizens to
communicate with there Delegates. To the north the enourmous Directorate
palace towers over the surrounding area.

Muted Terran Union insignia and secure public galleries reinforce the formal character of the Earth Assembly.
~
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    450
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction west~
ToRoom    10101
#ENDEXIT

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     10101
Name     Assembly Hall Entrance~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob indoors~
Desc     The entrance to the Assembly Hall consists of wide stone steps that lead up
to the ancient building. Stone pillars flank the large double doors.
Statuettes are carved around the eves.  Inside the doors is a small lobby.
Beyond it to the east is the hall of opinions.

The chamber's architecture favors daylight, pale stone and transparent security partitions.
~
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    10100
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction west~
ToRoom    10102
#ENDEXIT

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     10102
Name     The Main Hallway~
Sector   city~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     This long hallway encircles the main floor of the Assembly. It si decorated
in white and gold. The walls are adorned with historical photographs and
plaques.

Delegation signs identify offices serving Earth and the wider Local Sphere.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    10103
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    10101
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    10104
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction west~
ToRoom    10120
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 10104 2 10102
Reset M 0 10104 2 10102
#ENDROOM

