Vnum     10118
Name     Bellow the Assembly Chamber~
Sector   city~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     This long hallway is carpeted in white. It mus be increadibly hard to keep
clean but whoever does it seems to be consistantly successful. The walls
are covered in a speckled gold surface. A holographic sign reads Delegates
only beyond this point.

The chamber's architecture favors daylight, pale stone and transparent security partitions.
~
